  "ja300:1.1": "Parapāṇarodhā jīvanto ",
  "ja300:1.2": "maṃsalohitabhojano ",
  "ja300:1.3": "vako vataṃ samādiyi ",
  "ja300:1.4": "upapajji uposathaṃ. ",
  "ja300:2.1": "Tassa Sakko vataṃ ñāya ",
  "ja300:2.2": "ajarūpen upāgami, ",
  "ja300:2.3": "vītatapo ajjhappatto ",
  "ja300:2.4": "bhañji lohitapo tapaṃ. ",
  "ja300:3.1": "Evam evaṃ idh' ekacce ",
  "ja300:3.2": "samādānasmiṃ dubbalā ",
  "ja300:3.3": "lahuṃ karonti attānaṃ ",
  "ja300:3.4": "vako va ajakāraṇāti Vivaratha ",
